.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt INTEL_STEPPING 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm intel_stepping
.Nd Display the stepping information for an Intel GPU
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Ss "SYNOPSIS"
.Bd -literal
     intel_stepping
.Ed
.Ss "DESCRIPTION"
.Bd -literal
     intel_stepping is a tool to print the stepping information for an Intel
     GPU, along with the PCI ID and revision used to determine it. It requires
     root privilege to map the graphics device.
.Ed
.Ss "BUGS"
.Bd -literal
     Not all the known stepping IDs or chipsets are included, so the output on
     some devices may not be as specific as possible.
.Ed
